---

Third-party components keep their own licenses and are NOT relicensed by this
file. The clocks load some libraries from a CDN at runtime (not bundled):
three.js (MIT), @vfx-js/core (MIT, by Amagi), roughjs (MIT), d3 (ISC), and
Google Fonts (OFL 1.1). Two clocks adapt third-party shaders, credited in the
file: liquid-glass (VFX-JS liquid-glass effect by Amagi, MIT) and refract
(Ksenia Kondrashova's "Broken Glass Effect"). Astronomical clocks use standard
algorithms (e.g. Jean Meeus). Keep those credits intact when reusing.
